{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/792f2765462d5ba768f380b69efcfff6.avif?t=1772751783\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/086e5894912a8957f7caf8a37f38be32.poster.avif?t=1772751783\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/086e5894912a8957f7caf8a37f38be32.webm?t=1772751783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/086e5894912a8957f7caf8a37f38be32.mp4?t=1772751783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a long time, the village of Wolfpine attracted all kinds of adventurers with the promise of treasure and glory. They stopped there to rest and restock before venturing further into the dangerous region full of magic and riches. However, recently, rumors appeared about these lands getting more dangerous, as if some long-forgotten evil awakened from its slumber and is now corrupting these lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Lynn, an ambitious young woman drawn to Wolfpine by strange dreams. She finds the village in ruins and takes the important task of restoring it and finding what caused its ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/adc91019f8d87980cdaee0d50ede389b.avif?t=1772751783\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/38fa60c65e259512a9f3899115f59c8a.poster.avif?t=1772751783\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/38fa60c65e259512a9f3899115f59c8a.webm?t=1772751783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/38fa60c65e259512a9f3899115f59c8a.mp4?t=1772751783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolfpine is your base for every adventure beyond the village. Journey past the gate to discover new places, meet strange creatures, and solve the mystery behind the attack on Wolfpine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventure brings you closer to your goal. Each restored house in the village unlocks new shops and upgrades, giving you more ways to delve deeper into the magical region. Upgrade your attributes, learn new abilities, and stock up on the best equipment and potions \u2013 then even harder enemies won\u2019t be a problem on your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/f97f8a9a1374b55e453561abcb6d9198.avif?t=1772751783\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/4b05b5f819b63bdf4d83cfa9f3618c17.poster.avif?t=1772751783\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/4b05b5f819b63bdf4d83cfa9f3618c17.webm?t=1772751783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/4b05b5f819b63bdf4d83cfa9f3618c17.mp4?t=1772751783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strategy matters more than your clicking speed. Choose the best abilities for your style and watch the battle unfold automatically. Defeat is not permanent, as a powerful charm keeps you from dying and brings you back to Wolfpine. Upgrade your character, adjust your combat abilities, and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/6ef1ef7d8719cc8999e7b9e5347f1126.avif?t=1772751783\" width=800 height=65 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/7a78e53f2f14e64f61bf0f6900fc653a.poster.avif?t=1772751783\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/7a78e53f2f14e64f61bf0f6900fc653a.webm?t=1772751783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777640/extras/7a78e53f2f14e64f61bf0f6900fc653a.mp4?t=1772751783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a rich cast of characters in Wolfpine and the nearby lands. Some will try to trick you or slow you down, while others will guide you and help you on your adventure. But one thing they all have in common is that they\u2019re a bit <strong>lecherous</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2777640?t=1772751783","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store